Root cause of all 24 UI failures: src/index.ts never serves the HTML. public/index.html, login.html, signup.html, lookup.html exist with the right data-testids, but there is no route serving them, so every page is blank and playwright times out on fill.

Add exactly this to stage-2/src/index.ts (before app.listen), then commit:
  import path from 'path';
  import fs from 'fs';
  const PUB = path.join(__dirname, '..', 'public');
  const page = (f: string) => (_req: any, res: any) => {
